"type":4,"typeName":"固有技能","typeNameEn":"Inherent Skill","name":"咩咩加油歌","nameEn":"Woolies Cheer Dance","maxLevel":1,"desc":"施放共鸣技能热力羊咩或共鸣技能黑咩·狂热时，安可的热熔伤害加成提升10%，效果持续10秒。","descEn":"When Resonance Skill Flaming Woolies or Resonance Skill Cosmos - Rampage is cast, Encore's Fusion DMG Bonus is increased by 10% for 10s.","params":[],"hits":[],"confidence":"high","skillIcon":"assets/skills/1000705.webp?v=c55f91aa4bea"},{"id":1000706,"type":5,"typeName":"变奏技能","typeNameEn":"Intro Skill","name":"咩咩帮手","nameEn":"Woolies Helpers","maxLevel":10,"desc":"与黑咩一起从天而降，攻击目标，造成热熔伤害。","descEn":"Encore pounces at the enemies with Cosmos, dealing Fusion DMG.","params":[{"label":"技能伤害","labelEn":"Skill DMG","values":["100.00%","108.20%","116.40%","127.88%","136.08%","145.51%","158.63%","171.75%","184.87%","198.81%"]},{"label":"回复协奏能量","labelEn":"Concerto Regen","values":["10","10","10","10","10","10","10","10","10","10"]}],"hits":[{"label":"技能伤害","labelEn":"Skill DMG","term":0,"count":1,"multiplier":[1.0,1.082,1.164,1.2788,1.3608,1.4551,1.5863,1.7175,1.8487,1.9881],"damageId":1203601002,"type":"intro","typeId":3,"typeName":"变奏技能","calc":"damage","element":"fusion","elementId":2,"scaling":"atk","rateField":"RateLv","flat":null,"energy":[10.0],"concerto":[0.0],"elementPowerType":2,"toughness":[1.0088],"offTune":[1.5132],"hardness":[1.0],"formulaType":0,"subType":[],"damageIds":[1203601002],"confidence":"high"}],"concertoGain":10.0,"confidence":"high","skillIcon":"assets/skills/1000706.webp?v=d833c3a2625e"},{"id":1000707,"type":6,"typeName":"共鸣回路","typeNameEn":"Forte Circuit","name":"黑白羊咩","nameEn":"Black & White Woolies","maxLevel":10,"desc":"重击·白咩·失控之炎\n施放重击时，若安可攒满【失序值】，安可会消耗所有的【失序值】进入失序状态，处于失序状态时安可受到伤害降低70%，切换角色不会中断失序状态。\n失序状态结束后，施放失控之炎，造成热熔伤害，此次伤害为共鸣解放伤害。\n \n重击·黑咩·暴走之炎\n黑咩大暴走期间，施放重击时，若安可攒满【失序值】，安可会消耗所有的【失序值】进入黑咩失序状态，处于黑咩失序状态时安可受到伤害降低70%，切换角色不会中断黑咩失序状态。\n黑咩失序状态结束后，施放暴走之炎，造成热熔伤害，此次伤害为共鸣解放伤害。\n \n失序值获取规则\n【失序值】上限100点。\n常态攻击羊咩出击命中目标时，回复【失序值】。\n共鸣技能热力羊咩命中目标时，回复【失序值】。\n共鸣技能热情欢迎式命中目标时，回复【失序值】。\n变奏技能咩咩帮手命中目标时，回复【失序值】。\n共鸣解放黑咩大暴走持续期间命中目标时，回复【失序值】。","descEn":"Heavy Attack: Cloudy Frenzy\nWhen Encore's \"Mayhem\" is full, after casting a Heavy Attack, Encore will consume all \"Mayhem\" to enter the Mayhem state, reducing damage taken by 70%. Switching Characters does not interrupt the Mayhem state.\nAfter the Mayhem state ends, Encore will cast Cloudy Frenzy, dealing Fusion DMG, considered as Resonance Liberation damage.\n \nHeavy Attack: Cosmos Rupture\nDuring Cosmos Rave, when casting Heavy Attack, if \"Mayhem\" is full, Encore will consume all \"Mayhem\" to enter Cosmos' Mayhem state, reducing damage taken by 70%. Switching Characters does not interrupt the Cosmos' Mayhem state.\nAfter Cosmos' Mayhem state ends, Encore will cast Cosmos Rupture, dealing Fusion DMG, considered as Resonance Liberation DMG. \nMayhem\nEncore can hold up to 100 \"Mayhem\".\nWhen Normal Attack Wooly Attack hits a target, Encore restores \"Mayhem\".\nWhen Resonance Skill Flaming Woolies hits a target, Encore restores \"Mayhem\".\nWhen Resonance Skill Energetic Welcome hits a target, Encore restores \"Mayhem\".\nWhen Intro Skill Woolies Helpers hits a target, Encore restores \"Mayhem\".\nDuring the duration of Resonance Liberation Cosmos Rave, Encore restores \"Mayhem\" when hitting a target.","params":[{"label":"白咩·失控之炎伤害","labelEn":"Cloudy Frenzy Damage","values":["168.00%","181.77%","195.55%","214.83%","228.61%","244.45%","266.49%","288.53%","310.58%","334.00%"]},{"label":"黑咩·暴走之炎伤害","labelEn":"Cosmos Rupture Damage","values":["23.35%*6+249.08%","25.26%*6+269.51%","27.18%*6+289.93%","29.86%*6+318.53%","31.77%*6+338.95%","33.97%*6+362.44%","37.04%*6+395.12%","40.10%*6+427.80%","43.17%*6+460.48%","46.42%*6+495.21%"]},{"label":"白咩·失控之炎回复协奏能量","labelEn":"Cloudy Frenzy Concerto Regen","values":["10","10","10","10","10","10","10","10","10","10"]},{"label":"黑咩·暴走之炎回复协奏能量","labelEn":"Cosmos Rupture Concerto Regen","values":["10","10","10","10","10","10","10","10","10","10"]}],"hits":[